      "end": 496,
      "start": 0,
      "text": "Temple of Isis\nSeveral archaeological sites and ancient complexes have included an Iseum or temple of Isis , an important goddess in ancient Egyptian , Greek , and Roman religion : The Egyptian complex at Philae The Egyptian complex at Behbeit el-Hagar The Greek island of Delos The Roman temple of Isis on the Campus Martius in Rome The Roman Temple of Isis at Pompeii The reconstructed Roman temple of Isis at Szombathely in Hungary The Egyptian temple of Isis on Antirhodos island , Alexandria"
