    "spans": [
     {
      "end": 322,
      "start": 0,
      "text": "Crinisus\nThis is also the name of a river in Sicily , the River Crinisus . Crinisus was a god in Roman mythology . According to Virgil 's Aeneid ( 5.38 ) and Hyginus ' Fabulae ( 273 ) , Crinisus was the father of Acestes by a Dardanian woman . Category : Deities in the Aeneid Category : Roman mythology Category : Potamoi"
     }
