      "end": 363,
      "start": 0,
      "text": "Nephthys\nNephthys or Nebthet or Neber-Het '' ` was a goddess in ancient Egyptian religion . A member of the Great Ennead of Heliopolis in Egyptian mythology , she was a daughter of Nut and Geb . Nephthys was typically paired with her sister Isis in funerary rites because of their role as protectors of the mummy and the god Osiris and as the sister-wife of Set ."
